        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173130/extras/4274182b0e15b972739a55bdfb231bb0.avif?t=1786734050\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help save the kitties from the zombie apocalypse!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >huge map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 objects to find (cats and zombies) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 special objects (milk bottles) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress saving </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress reset </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173130/extras/244263b06dcff50dada1a6e7503c561c.avif?t=1786734050\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats VS Zombies is a hidden object game – the player's task is to find cats hidden on the map and eliminate the zombies. The game is designed in a zombie apocalypse style, but with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to contamination, an epidemic has broken out – zombies have taken over the entire military base and are wreaking havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last survivor, once a member of an elite cat sniper unit. The cat army has dropped ammunition supplies – these can be found in wooden crates. Your mission is to eliminate all the zombies and rescue the cats. Go, cat soldier! Meow!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173130/extras/4274182b0e15b972739a55bdfb231bb0.avif?t=1786734050\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help save the kitties from the zombie apocalypse!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >huge map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 objects to find (cats and zombies) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 special objects (milk bottles) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress saving </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress reset </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173130/extras/244263b06dcff50dada1a6e7503c561c.avif?t=1786734050\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats VS Zombies is a hidden object game – the player's task is to find cats hidden on the map and eliminate the zombies. The game is designed in a zombie apocalypse style, but with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to contamination, an epidemic has broken out – zombies have taken over the entire military base and are wreaking havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last survivor, once a member of an elite cat sniper unit. The cat army has dropped ammunition supplies – these can be found in wooden crates. Your mission is to eliminate all the zombies and rescue the cats. Go, cat soldier! Meow!</p>",
